---
interface Props {
  variant?: 'compact' | 'full';
}

const { variant = 'full' } = Astro.props;
---

<div id="lead-pack" class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-500/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-cinema-900 via-cinema-900 to-amber-950/30 p-6 sm:p-8 glow-amber">
  <!-- Decorative film icon background -->
  <div class="absolute -right-8 -bottom-8 text-9xl text-amber-500/5 select-none pointer-events-none font-serif">
    🎬
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
      <span>🎁</span> 岛主开局实战礼包 · 免费获取
    </div>

    <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-snug">
      《短剧爽点全景图 XMind》<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      <span class="text-amber-400 font-serif">+ 20赛道作战手册与前3集节拍表</span>
    </h3>

    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-cinema-300 leading-relaxed">
      十年编剧内部自用核心武器库。包含：完整《短剧爽点_全景图.xmind》高清源脑图、20大男女频/海外赛道爆款配方、3-30-90 节奏尺自查表、以及直接复制进 Midjourney/ComfyUI 的镜头景别 Prompt 词库。
    </p>

    <!-- Acquisition Area: WeChat Quick-Add + Email Input -->
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
      <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-cinema-950 border border-cinema-700 text-white text-sm">
        <span class="text-cinema-400 text-xs">💬 岛主个人微信：</span>
        <span class="text-amber-400 font-mono font-bold select-all text-base">bl-free</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-cinema-400 hidden sm:inline">(备注: 爽点脑图)</span>
      </div>
      <button
        type="button"
        onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('bl-free').then(() => alert('已复制岛主微信【bl-free】到剪贴板！\n\n请在微信添加好友并备注「爽点脑图」，岛主将第一时间把《短剧爽点_全景图.xmind》高清工程文件与前3集节拍表发送给你。'))"
        class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-amber-500 hover:from-amber-300 hover:to-amber-400 text-cinema-950 font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-md shadow-amber-500/20 active:scale-95 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5"
      >
        <span>📋</span>
        <span>一键复制微信 (免费索取)</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs text-cinema-400">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
        <span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> 配套原版 .xmind 矢量工程文件
      </span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
        <span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> 格式涵盖 Markdown / Notion / PDF
      </span>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
        <span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> 100% 真实案头积累，无套路
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
